<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>原理①：四类决策里，只有 x 与 π 进搜索空间</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>04 第二阶段 · 原理</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>编码维度是最贵的资源：每多一维，组合空间指数膨胀；能确定性或精确求解的一律踢出去。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, gap: 2}}><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#1E4FA8', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>决策</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 180, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>进搜索空间</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 250, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>由谁决定</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 580, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>为什么这样分工</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>x 归属</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 180, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>✓ 起始基因</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 250, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>DMDE 搜索</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 580, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>哪架机飞哪些任务是真组合问题，没有已知多项式解法；必须交给搜索。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>π 顺序</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 180, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>✓ 巡游基因</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 250, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>DMDE 搜索</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 580, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>段内先后是 MTSP 本质，与归属耦合：改归属会改变最优顺序，二者必须同空间联合搜索。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>y 是否执行</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 180, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>✗ 不占维度</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 250, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>解码端修复链裁量</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 580, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>「可达即执行」是硬约束；删除只发生在物理不可行时。若给它一维让搜索决定删不删，搜索会用「删任务」刷低成本。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>z 终点机巢</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 180, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>✗ 不占维度</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 250, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>内层最小费用流精确解</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 580, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>航线一旦给定就是带容量的小规模运输问题，存在多项式精确解；交给搜索只会拖慢，且找不到更优。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 13, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>设计判断：把 y 与 z 留在编码外，是「每个任务恰出现一次」紧致结构与基因长度恒为 N 的前提。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>一旦让「不执行」占维度，基因长度不再恒为 N，差分算子会在可变长向量上作差而失效。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 方法讲解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>12 / 19</Text></Box></Slide>